cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use webgpu-q in academic work, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "webgpu-q: Browser-native quantum chemistry and many-body simulation via WebGPU"
authors:
  - family-names: Günaydın
    given-names: Ahmet Barış
    email: hi@barisgunaydin.com
    affiliation: Independent researcher
